IMPORT policy

-- Standing preamble (applies to every query below): assume all other
-- conditions are met and no other exclusions apply; the agreement has been
-- signed and the premium has been paid on time. Every field not put in
-- issue by the question text is set here to a value that keeps every other
-- coverage condition satisfied and no exclusion triggered.

-- Q1: hospitalized by burns suffered while doing my duty as a firefighter.
-- The burns are an accidental injury; the cause is service as a
-- firefighter, one of the four listed general exclusions.
q1 MEANS Claim WITH
  `agreement signed`                           IS TRUE
  `premium paid month`                         IS JUST 0
  `hospitalization month`                      IS 3
  `hospitalization ground`                     IS `Accidental injury`
  `age at hospitalization`                     IS 45
  `causes`                                     IS LIST Firefighting
  `fraud month`                                IS NOTHING
  `misrepresentation month`                    IS NOTHING
  `wellness visit month`                       IS JUST 5
  `wellness visit provider qualified`          IS TRUE
  `written confirmation month`                 IS JUST 6
  `dispute arisen`                             IS FALSE
  `unable to settle month`                     IS NOTHING
  `arbitration commenced month`                IS NOTHING
  `valid arbitration award issued`             IS FALSE
  `written proof of claim month`               IS JUST 3
  `recovery sought month`                      IS NOTHING
  `policy term months`                         IS 12
  `confined in us hospital`                    IS TRUE
  `continuous confinement days`                IS JUST 5
  `claim made setting out basis`               IS TRUE
#EVAL covered q1

